Subject: [PATCH] Preserve saved data when NBT compression fails


diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/level/storage/LevelStorageSource.java b/net/minecraft/world/level/storage/LevelStorageSource.java
index 3fa69608fbc348df64d4e08baf60b7a2d455a392..0e87249ced87fcf7fedbae73fed514b046b43bae 100644
